<h3>Check how a basket or bundle offer works</h3>
<p>Products listed in this collection are not automatically a fixed-price kit. Read any active offer instructions, qualifying items and checkout conditions before ordering. If you want an existing set, compare the dedicated combos collection and its exact pack contents. Current product prices and stock options should guide your basket.</p>
